-PhysReg(1)  = rbx (callee-saved)
-PhysReg(2-5) = rcx, rdx, rsi, rdi (caller-saved, params)
-PhysReg(6-7) = r8, r9 (caller-saved, params)
-PhysReg(8-9) = r10, r11 (caller-saved, scratch)
-PhysReg(10-13) = r12-r15 (callee-saved)
-```
