+
+# expat after ./configure
+lccc -O2 -S -I. -Ilib -DHAVE_EXPAT_CONFIG_H lib/xmltok.c
+```
+
+Artifacts from this run: `/home/user/ra-bench/` (asm + binaries).
+Not committed (generated).
